{"anime_data":{"id":278815,"name":"はたらく細胞!!","name_cn":"工作细胞！！","short_summary":"这是关于你的故事。\r\n是在你体内的故事——\r\n人类的细胞数量，约为37兆个（新说）。细胞们在名为身体的世界中，今天也在精神满满无休无眠地工作。运输氧气的红血球、与细菌战斗的白血球……那里有关于细胞们的不为人知的戏剧。随着新的细胞、新的细菌与","score":6.8,"image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/ae/11/278815_veMhu.jpg","eps":8,"date":"2021-01-09","summary":"这是关于你的故事。\r\n是在你体内的故事——\r\n人类的细胞数量，约为37兆个（新说）。细胞们在名为身体的世界中，今天也在精神满满无休无眠地工作。运输氧气的红血球、与细菌战斗的白血球……那里有关于细胞们的不为人知的戏剧。随着新的细胞、新的细菌与病毒一起登场的全新展开。","total_episodes":8,"characters":[{"id":60455,"name":"赤血球","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c5/b3/60455_crt_FD4cR.jpg?r=1516938274","actor_ids":[4765,79188],"name_cn":"红血球（AE3803）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"红血球（AE3803）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60456,"name":"白血球","relation":"主角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/79/53/60456_crt_6EUyY.jpg?r=1516938387","actor_ids":[5121,79177],"name_cn":"白血球（U-1146）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"白血球（U-1146）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60457,"name":"キラーT細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/25/ce/60457_crt_5q7s9.jpg?r=1537843531","actor_ids":[4456,76687],"name_cn":"杀手T细胞","summary":"ウイルス感染細胞、癌細胞などの異物を認識・破壊する殺し屋。\r\nヘルパーＴ細胞の命令によって出動する。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"杀手T细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"http://hataraku-saibou.com/character/?chara=killer_t_cell","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60458,"name":"マクロファージ","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/bb/04/60458_crt_T17VN.jpg?r=1537843706","actor_ids":[3945],"name_cn":"巨噬细胞","summary":"細菌などの異物を捕らえて殺し、抗原や免疫情報を見つけ出す。\r\n死んだ細胞や細菌を片付ける役割も有している。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"巨噬细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"http://hataraku-saibou.com/character/?chara=macrophage","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":60459,"name":"血小板","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/8b/b9/60459_crt_nGmre.jpg?r=1531049545","actor_ids":[14918,58217,78925,78955,79188],"name_cn":"血小板","summary":"血管が損傷した際に集合し、傷口をふさいで止血する。\r\n一般的な細胞よりはサイズが小さい。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"血小板","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"http://hataraku-saibou.com/character/?chara=platelet","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":63050,"name":"ヘルパーT細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/e2/42/63050_crt_1td8L.jpg?r=1537842540","actor_ids":[4015,79115],"name_cn":"辅助性T细胞","summary":"外敵侵入の知らせを受け、敵の情報をもとに、\r\n的確に攻撃できるように戦略を決める司令官。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"辅助性T细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"引用来源","value":"http://hataraku-saibou.com/character/?chara=helper_t_cell","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":63052,"name":"制御性T細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/1a/9e/63052_crt_hqHP8.jpg?r=1537842601","actor_ids":[4895,78925],"name_cn":"调节性T细胞","summary":"T細胞の暴走を抑え、免疫異常を起こさないように調整する。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"调节性T细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":63053,"name":"樹状細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/3e/3c/63053_crt_2UVQ2.jpg?r=1537842681","actor_ids":[4950,78948],"name_cn":"树突细胞","summary":"体内に侵入してきた細菌や、ウイルス感染細胞などの断片を抗原として提示し、他の免疫系の細胞に伝える役割を持つ。その名の通り周囲に突起を伸ばしている。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"树突细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":63054,"name":"好酸球","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/6f/e9/63054_crt_NdVty.jpg?r=1537843274","actor_ids":[10887,78955,79165],"name_cn":"嗜酸性粒细胞","summary":"アレルギーや寄生虫感染があるとき増殖する。弱いながらも他の白血球のように貪食能力がある。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"嗜酸性粒细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64601,"name":"先輩赤血球","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/cc/1d/64601_crt_kbFEo.jpg?r=1536463744","actor_ids":[4893,58217,78925,79165],"name_cn":"红血球前辈","summary":"赤血球(AE3808)の先輩。面倒見がよい。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"红血球前辈","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64602,"name":"記憶細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c6/68/64602_crt_x6iBh.jpg?r=1537843430","actor_ids":[4724,79115],"name_cn":"记忆细胞","summary":"抗原の免疫を記憶しているリンパ球。同じ細菌やウイルスの再度の侵入に備えている。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"记忆细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64603,"name":"B細胞","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/1b/a3/64603_crt_HhY7B.jpg?r=1537843005","actor_ids":[19619,79187],"name_cn":"B细胞","summary":"細菌やウイルスなどの抗原に対し、抗体という武器を作り、戦うリンパ球の一種。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"B细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64604,"name":"マスト細胞（肥満細胞）","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/fa/45/64604_crt_2IOyK.jpg?r=1537843620","actor_ids":[740,78925],"name_cn":"肥大细胞","summary":"過剰につくられたIgEの刺激に反応してヒスタミンやロイコトリエンなどの化学物質を分担する。肥満細胞といっても肥満とは関係ない。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"肥大细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"女","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64886,"name":"白血球（2048）","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c4/c6/64886_crt_l8gPv.jpg","actor_ids":[5658,76687],"name_cn":"白血球（2048）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"白血球（2048）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64887,"name":"白血球（2626）","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/47/87/64887_crt_LGgFp.jpg","actor_ids":[6278,79115],"name_cn":"白血球（2626）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"白血球（2626）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":64888,"name":"白血球（4989）","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/83/bd/64888_crt_uZRUL.jpg","actor_ids":[19514,78948],"name_cn":"白血球（4989）","summary":"","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"白血球（4989）","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":65087,"name":"好塩基球","relation":"配角","image_url":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/20/78/65087_crt_NcdNb.jpg?r=1537843375","actor_ids":[4513,76687],"name_cn":"嗜碱性粒细胞","summary":"白血球の一種。全白血球の1％未満と言われている。\r\n好塩基球が特定の抗原に出会うとヒスタミンなどが放出され、アレルギー反応を引き起こすとされている。\r\n好中球と好酸球を問題部位に引き寄せる物質を作る。好塩基球にも免疫にかかかる機能があると考えられているが、まだ十分に解明されていない。","birth_year":null,"birth_month":null,"birth_day":null,"tags":[{"key":"简体中文名","value":"嗜碱性粒细胞","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"},{"key":"性别","value":"男","__dataclass__":"KeyValue"}],"__dataclass__":"Character"},{"id":65089,"name":"カンピロバクター","relati